<title>HONG KONG: Trade in Styland shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Styland shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of garment and consumer electronics concern Styland Holdings Ltd was suspended on Friday at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.  </p>
<p>On Thursday, Styland shares rose HK$0.01 to HK$0.41 on volume of 33.18 million shares.</p>
<p>The company also engages in property development and security trading.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
